From c2fbe889040f6ff914ba4577612e67dec69839c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:21:33 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed player side panel

Moves the player's play queue to a side panel on the left, following the Figma "Player" frame. The panel sits between the title bar and the control bar and pushes the video stage to the right instead of covering it.

- SidePanelRail: 50px icon rail with Home, Video, Music and Browse (open that library page), Play Queue (shown as current) and Add (open media dialog).
- PlaylistPane gets a juxtStyle mode: a "Play Queue" title with more and pop out buttons, an item count row with sort and search, and a divider instead of the column header.
- PlaylistDelegate gets a juxtStyle mode: 32px thumbnail and a single 14px line of text, without artist or duration.
- Adds a "popout" glyph to the icon font from the design's panel-popout icon.
